1
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:10,880
A human's nose

2
00:01:10,880 --> 00:01:12,920
is never as sensitive as a dog's.

3
00:01:13,320 --> 00:01:13,960
My Lord,

4
00:01:13,960 --> 00:01:15,320
this concerns His Majesty's safety.

5
00:01:15,320 --> 00:01:16,720
We cannot afford any delay.

6
00:01:16,720 --> 00:01:17,720
You all stay here.

7
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:18,840
You, come with me.

8
00:01:32,320 --> 00:01:33,720
What is this pill made of?

9
00:01:34,960 --> 00:01:35,690
Lead the way.

10
00:02:03,360 --> 00:02:04,040
Everyone, be careful.

11
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:06,960
Pulling out the heads and picking the vegetables,

12
00:02:06,960 --> 00:02:10,479
the world becomes a better place.

13
00:02:10,919 --> 00:02:14,640
Three thousand locks in the Zhimi Pavilion.

14
00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:16,740
Five hundred strings of cash,

15
00:02:16,840 --> 00:02:17,920
breaking heads.

16
00:02:17,920 --> 00:02:19,800
This is a nursery rhyme circulating in the streets.

17
00:02:19,800 --> 00:02:20,560
It mocks those high officials

18
00:02:20,560 --> 00:02:21,560
who oppress the people.

19
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:22,040
Taoist,

20
00:02:22,640 --> 00:02:23,280
Should we

21
00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:24,600
just go back?

22
00:02:43,760 --> 00:02:46,280
You must be the Master of Wuyou Cave.

23
00:02:46,440 --> 00:02:48,360
We are all in the same circle.

24
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:51,760
Why play these tricks to mystify things?

25
00:02:52,240 --> 00:02:55,160
So you are the distinguished disciple of Master Luo from Erxian Mountain.

26
00:02:55,160 --> 00:02:57,220
I failed to recognize a great person.

27
00:02:57,720 --> 00:02:58,920
Everyone, please calm down.

28
00:02:58,920 --> 00:03:01,600
I have a small matter to deal with first.

29
00:03:26,120 --> 00:03:30,160
An old customer wanted to sleep with the bride

30
00:03:30,920 --> 00:03:33,000
and asked me to kidnap her.

31
00:03:33,400 --> 00:03:37,200
But he only paid Wuyou City half the silver.

32
00:03:37,480 --> 00:03:38,720
So,

33
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:40,920
I can only give him half.

34
00:03:41,840 --> 00:03:43,079
Cave Chief,

35
00:03:43,079 --> 00:03:44,880
why be like this?

36
00:03:45,880 --> 00:03:49,120
We can just discuss business at the table.

37
00:03:49,840 --> 00:03:50,840
Cave Chief.

38
00:03:50,840 --> 00:03:52,520
The rules of Wuyou City are,

39
00:03:52,800 --> 00:03:53,840
if a guest doesn't sit,

40
00:03:53,840 --> 00:03:55,100
they shouldn't speak.

41
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:56,600
If no wine is drunk,

42
00:03:56,600 --> 00:03:58,160
no business is done.

43
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:03,280
Then thank you, Cave Chief, for your hospitality.

44
00:04:08,280 --> 00:04:10,880
Uncle Chai has depended on dogs since childhood.

45
00:04:10,880 --> 00:04:12,340
Sensitive sense of smell.

46
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:16,480
I want to see where Liu Heizi can run to.

47
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:22,490
I want him alive.

48
00:04:35,440 --> 00:04:36,520
Master.

49
00:04:37,560 --> 00:04:39,080
The wine has gone down.

50
00:04:40,520 --> 00:04:41,600
Now,

51
00:04:41,600 --> 00:04:43,240
can I talk to you?

52
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:44,240
Please.

53
00:04:45,200 --> 00:04:46,560
On the night of the Lantern Festival,

54
00:04:46,560 --> 00:04:48,080
if you could get us

55
00:04:48,080 --> 00:04:49,940
into the West Building of Fanlou,

56
00:04:50,440 --> 00:04:53,240
we are willing to offer you 10,000 strings of cash.

57
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:01,760
If your sincerity is only gold and silver,

58
00:05:02,200 --> 00:05:03,960
there is no need to talk further.

59
00:05:03,960 --> 00:05:04,640
Master.

60
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:08,640
Perhaps you have other wishes.

61
00:05:09,200 --> 00:05:10,280
As long as we Liangshan

62
00:05:10,280 --> 00:05:11,680
can help you achieve it.

63
00:05:11,840 --> 00:05:13,280
Absolutely.

64
00:05:21,560 --> 00:05:23,040
Map of Dongjing City.

65
00:05:26,880 --> 00:05:29,280
Privately drawing maps is a capital crime.

66
00:05:29,480 --> 00:05:31,610
How could Wuyou City have such a thing?

67
00:05:32,200 --> 00:05:32,930
Cave Master,

68
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:35,880
why are you showing this

69
00:05:37,320 --> 00:05:38,560
map of Dongjing City?

70
00:05:39,040 --> 00:05:40,240
To be honest, Daoist,

71
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:41,640
I have an enemy

72
00:05:41,840 --> 00:05:42,960
named Shedaoren.

73
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:46,920
Over the years, he has amassed wealth through waterways.

74
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:49,120
Unfortunately, we have a gentleman's agreement

75
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:50,850
to stay out of each other's way.

76
00:05:51,320 --> 00:05:51,880
Today,

77
00:05:51,880 --> 00:05:53,240
since I've met you all,

78
00:05:53,880 --> 00:05:55,200
I want to use your hands

79
00:05:55,880 --> 00:05:57,560
to ruin his business.

80
00:05:58,159 --> 00:06:00,560
There are only two days left until the Shangyuan Festival.

81
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:02,520
If you won't accept my terms,

82
00:06:02,520 --> 00:06:04,000
then you can find someone else.

83
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:04,930
My Wuyou Cave...

84
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:06,660
I will never force you to stay.

85
00:06:08,320 --> 00:06:10,320
What does the Cave Master need us to do?

86
00:06:10,320 --> 00:06:11,520
Just say it directly.

87
00:06:11,840 --> 00:06:14,000
My rival is involved in smuggling salt

88
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:15,330
and human trafficking.

89
00:06:15,560 --> 00:06:16,280
This river

90
00:06:17,040 --> 00:06:18,520
is the channel they use to transport smuggled salt

91
00:06:18,520 --> 00:06:20,850
and trafficked women into Dongjing City.

92
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:21,580
Bian River.

93
00:06:21,880 --> 00:06:22,680
Brother Meng,

94
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:24,160
what's so special

95
00:06:24,280 --> 00:06:25,540
about this Bian River?

96
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:27,140
You are not from Dongjing,

97
00:06:27,400 --> 00:06:28,400
so you don't know.

98
00:06:28,960 --> 00:06:29,820
This Bian River

99
00:06:29,880 --> 00:06:31,560
not only handles water transport,

100
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:33,040
but also the gold, silver, spices,

101
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:34,440
tribute tea, and so on from the south.

102
00:06:34,440 --> 00:06:36,240
Even the flowers and stones used by the emperor

103
00:06:36,240 --> 00:06:38,520
are transported to the capital through it.

104
00:06:38,520 --> 00:06:40,800
The emperor attaches great importance to this Bian River.

105
00:06:40,800 --> 00:06:42,060
Around the Bian River,

106
00:06:42,280 --> 00:06:44,360
a large-scale patrol force is deployed,

107
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:45,640
stationed along the river.

108
00:06:45,640 --> 00:06:46,300
Sometimes,

109
00:06:46,720 --> 00:06:48,000
even the imperial guards are mobilized

110
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:49,159
to participate in the patrol.

111
00:06:49,159 --> 00:06:49,760
Normally,

112
00:06:49,760 --> 00:06:50,600
not even a fly

113
00:06:51,120 --> 00:06:52,780
could fly over the Bian River.

114
00:06:53,080 --> 00:06:55,280
Those doing business on the Bian River,

115
00:06:55,560 --> 00:06:56,200
I am afraid,

116
00:06:56,200 --> 00:06:58,560
their boats have hidden compartments at the bottom.

117
00:06:58,560 --> 00:07:00,560
Smuggled salt and drugged women

118
00:07:00,640 --> 00:07:01,840
are placed inside.

119
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:03,360
So, whether by their appearance

120
00:07:03,360 --> 00:07:04,960
or by boarding inspections,

121
00:07:04,960 --> 00:07:06,760
you can't see anything unusual.

122
00:07:06,960 --> 00:07:08,080
What I want you to do

123
00:07:08,600 --> 00:07:10,040
is to expose his business

124
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:11,160
to the world.

125
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:13,400
It's best to make it known

126
00:07:13,560 --> 00:07:14,560
to the whole city.

127
00:07:15,720 --> 00:07:16,480
Okay.

128
00:07:16,720 --> 00:07:18,840
We'll help you fulfill your wish, Cave Master.

129
00:07:18,840 --> 00:07:19,320
But

130
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:21,720
you must also keep your promise to us.

131
00:07:47,640 --> 00:07:48,370
Cave Master,

132
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:51,640
I also have a favor to ask.

133
00:07:52,760 --> 00:07:53,560
Tell me.

134
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:56,400
On my way here,

135
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:58,360
I saw an old man looking for his daughter.

136
00:07:58,360 --> 00:07:59,760
Do you know her whereabouts?

137
00:07:59,760 --> 00:08:00,560
Daughter?

138
00:08:01,360 --> 00:08:03,120
Are you talking about the lantern bearer?

139
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:03,720
Exactly.

140
00:08:04,240 --> 00:08:05,700
So he didn't just survive,

141
00:08:05,800 --> 00:08:07,200
he hasn't given up either.

142
00:08:07,200 --> 00:08:08,720
Please tell me, Cave Master.

143
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:09,780
I'd appreciate it.

144
00:08:09,880 --> 00:08:11,720
Your gratitude is worthless to me.

145
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:12,850
What's the use of it?

146
00:08:13,640 --> 00:08:15,770
I can help ruin your rival's business.

147
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:18,400
That's between the Taoist priest and me.

148
00:08:18,400 --> 00:08:20,000
It has nothing to do with you.

149
00:08:20,080 --> 00:08:21,410
If you insist on asking,

150
00:08:21,800 --> 00:08:22,560
you'll have to make

151
00:08:22,560 --> 00:08:23,760
another deal with me.

152
00:08:23,960 --> 00:08:24,480
Then,

153
00:08:25,120 --> 00:08:25,880
wait for me

154
00:08:26,440 --> 00:08:27,480
to finish their business,

155
00:08:27,480 --> 00:08:28,880
and I'll come back to you.

156
00:08:34,799 --> 00:08:36,400
Your good karma has arrived.

157
00:08:37,760 --> 00:08:38,640
Young man,

158
00:08:39,039 --> 00:08:40,799
any news about my daughter?

159
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:44,680
I've asked the Master of Wuyou Cave.

160
00:08:44,680 --> 00:08:46,000
Wait a couple more days.

161
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:47,080
Did the Master of Wuyou Cave

162
00:08:47,080 --> 00:08:48,920
make any harsh demands?

163
00:08:49,400 --> 00:08:50,000
He

164
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:51,560
asked me to do something for him

165
00:08:51,560 --> 00:08:52,690
before he'd help me.

166
00:08:53,080 --> 00:08:54,360
Do you need my help?

167
00:08:55,200 --> 00:08:56,040
No need.

168
00:08:59,040 --> 00:09:00,880
I'll help them finish their task first,

169
00:09:00,880 --> 00:09:02,520
then I'll help you find your daughter.

170
00:09:02,520 --> 00:09:04,200
Your great kindness, young man,

171
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:05,880
even if my body is smashed to pieces,

172
00:09:05,880 --> 00:09:06,760
I will repay.

173
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:08,000
Old man,

174
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:10,640
wait until you're reunited with your daughter

175
00:09:10,640 --> 00:09:11,960
before thanking me.

176
00:09:12,280 --> 00:09:12,800
Okay.

177
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:14,700
I'll take your word for it.

178
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:22,860
Hurry up and go.

179
00:09:23,960 --> 00:09:24,840
Young man Meng,

180
00:09:25,400 --> 00:09:27,640
don't let external matters disturb you.

181
00:09:27,640 --> 00:09:28,960
Take care, old man.

182
00:09:37,360 --> 00:09:39,400
He really treats himself like a dog.

183
00:09:40,320 --> 00:09:41,640
Every time I see him,

184
00:09:42,160 --> 00:09:43,800
I feel extremely disgusted.

185
00:09:44,040 --> 00:09:46,800
What is the most important duty of our Bingjingwu?

186
00:09:46,800 --> 00:09:49,200
To protect the safety of the imperial city.

187
00:09:49,280 --> 00:09:50,540
For villains like him,

188
00:09:50,960 --> 00:09:52,420
as long as they are useful,

189
00:09:53,040 --> 00:09:54,600
they are acceptable.

190
00:09:54,800 --> 00:09:56,040
Understood.

191
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:03,000
Brother Meng.

192
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:04,800
You're known as the geography expert.

193
00:10:04,800 --> 00:10:07,320
Why don't you tell us more about the Bian River?

194
00:10:07,320 --> 00:10:09,280
The Bian River is 40 zhang wide and 6 chi deep.

195
00:10:09,280 --> 00:10:10,480
As I said before,

196
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:12,680
the government attaches great importance to it.

197
00:10:12,680 --> 00:10:14,480
Patrols inspect it day and night.

198
00:10:14,480 --> 00:10:16,210
If you are not absolutely sure,

199
00:10:16,240 --> 00:10:17,280
don't act rashly.

200
00:10:17,400 --> 00:10:18,280
Brother Meng.

201
00:10:18,800 --> 00:10:20,130
Don't worry about that.

202
00:10:20,240 --> 00:10:21,720
With my brother Li Lang here,

203
00:10:21,720 --> 00:10:23,180
the Bian River is nothing.

204
00:10:23,480 --> 00:10:24,920
My title 'White Streak in the Waves'

205
00:10:24,920 --> 00:10:26,680
is truly well-deserved.

206
00:10:28,760 --> 00:10:29,520
Shh.

207
00:10:32,760 --> 00:10:33,820
Someone is coming.

208
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:35,200
And more than one.

209
00:10:42,920 --> 00:10:43,720
Liu Heizi.
